[en.DECISION_C04_WEATHER_FACTORY_TOURIST]
Visitor to the Weather Factory

[en.DECISION_C04_WEATHER_FACTORY_TOURIST_desc]
It is said that an imperial official from Cantelot is going to visit the weather factory? This is in the jurisdiction of Cloudsdale, Cantelot can naturally go to Cloudsdale for a visit. But what does this mean? Does the Empire want to occupy the Weather Factory that has long been controlled by Cloudsdale and Stratusburg?

[zh.DECISION_C04_WEATHER_FACTORY_TOURIST]
天气工厂的访客

[zh.DECISION_C04_WEATHER_FACTORY_TOURIST_desc]
听说，有一位来自坎特洛特的帝国官员要参观天气工厂？虽说这在云中城的辖区，坎特洛特也自然能以访问云中城的理由前往，可这是什么意思？帝国希望占有长久以来被云中城和层云堡控制的天气工厂？
